From e670c411fd9b39d5edcd5c7341fb92844567a349 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 18:02:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: retain dm-verity artifacts for deferred unpack

fetch-only transfers/imports retain the selected signature/referrer graph, deferred unpack reconstructs layer annotations using the exact selected manifest, and capability/applier gating keeps overlayfs unchanged and fails closed for signed EROFS layers.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Copilot-Session: 3fad9689-50c6-480a-9f07-f805603944d1
